{%- comment -%}
  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Totterful / Hankie Pals — Our values
  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  A peach band holding four scattered "pebble" cards, each a blob with a hard
  coral blob behind it and an icon badge over its top edge.

  The pebble and its shadow are two different generated shapes rather than one
  shape offset twice. An offset copy shows the same width of coral all the way
  round; two shapes let it peek by 14px on one edge and nothing on another,
  which is what the reference does. Both come from scripts/gen-blob-paths.py.

  Each blob is drawn on a 0..100 grid and stretched into the card's 305x270
  box with preserveAspectRatio="none". The outline would stretch with it, so
  it is held at a true 2px by vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" rather than a
  width divided back out by the scale.

  The row is a grid of 300px columns, not the brief's absolute x positions of
  10 / 330 / 655 / 970. Four 300px columns in 1272 with a 24px gap land at
  0 / 324 / 648 / 972 — within 10px of every one of those — and unlike fixed
  offsets it still works when a merchant adds a fifth value or deletes one.
  The scatter comes from the per-card rotation and vertical offset, which are
  what actually make it read as pebbles.

  The vertical offset is a margin and the tilt is a transform, deliberately
  kept on different properties: the hover straightens the card and lifts it,
  and if the offset were part of the transform the hover would have to restate
  it or drop the card back into line.

  Copy is centred in the pebble rather than pinned at a fixed distance from
  the top. Two of these titles wrap to two lines and one does not, and a fixed
  offset puts the short one high in its blob.

  Each outline has a width as well as a colour, and 0 is a real setting: it is
  how the outline is removed. `| default:` is safe on it -- that filter
  replaces nil, false and the empty string, and a numeric 0 passes straight
  through. The badge keeps its 84px at any width, because Dawn sets
  box-sizing: border-box, so dropping the ring moves nothing around it.

  Ink, the pebble outline and the badge ring are three colours, not one. They
  default to the same value, so nothing looks different until one is changed,
  but the outline is a drawn line and the heading is type: wanting a softer
  outline is not wanting softer headings.

  No script at all. Sizes are px: Dawn's root font-size is 62.5%, so rem
  renders at 62.5% of its intended value. Every setting carries a `| default:`,
  because a setting added after a section was saved comes back nil on that
  saved instance.
  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings

  assign pebble_d = 'M 50.00 4.00 C 60.90 3.35, 76.73 7.69, 84.65 15.35 C 92.56 23.02, 98.09 39.04, 97.50 50.00 C 96.91 60.96, 89.03 73.11, 81.11 81.11 C 73.20 89.11, 60.49 97.88, 50.00 98.00 C 39.51 98.12, 26.43 89.82, 18.18 81.82 C 9.93 73.82, 0.32 60.43, 0.50 50.00 C 0.68 39.57, 10.99 26.91, 19.24 19.24 C 27.49 11.57, 39.10 4.65, 50.00 4.00 Z'
  # 0 is a real value here -- it is how an outline is removed -- and it does
  # survive `| default:`, which replaces only nil, false and the empty string.
  # It is false that `default` catches, not every falsy-looking value.
  assign pebble_line_w = s.pebble_outline_width | default: 2
  assign badge_line_w = s.badge_outline_width | default: 2

  assign shadow_d = 'M 50.00 6.00 C 60.96 6.12, 74.19 10.14, 82.53 17.47 C 90.86 24.81, 99.71 38.86, 100.00 50.00 C 100.29 61.14, 92.63 76.54, 84.29 84.29 C 75.96 92.04, 61.49 96.44, 50.00 96.50 C 38.51 96.56, 22.77 92.40, 15.35 84.65 C 7.94 76.90, 5.26 61.31, 5.50 50.00 C 5.74 38.69, 9.35 24.10, 16.77 16.77 C 24.18 9.43, 39.04 5.88, 50.00 6.00 Z'
-%}

{% style %}
  .hp-ov {
    /* The section keeps its own layering to itself. Without this its
       positioned children are ordered against every other section on the
       page, and a pebble here can paint over a section further down. */
    isolation: isolate;
    /* The sprinkles sit at the very edges of the row and the cards tilt past
       theirs. `clip` rather than `hidden`: no scroll container is created. */
    overflow-x: clip;

    --hp-ov-display: var(--font-heading-family, Bitter, "Chubbo", Georgia, serif);
    --hp-ov-body: var(--font-body-family, Lexend, "Quicksand", ui-rounded, system-ui, sans-serif);

    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 64px;
    background: var(--hp-ov-bg);
    padding-block: var(--hp-ov-pt) var(--hp-ov-pb);
    padding-inline: 24px;
  }

  /* --- Header -------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .hp-ov__head {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    max-width: 780px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hp-ov__eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 7px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--hp-ov-eyebrow-bg);
    font-family: var(--hp-ov-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--hp-ov-ink);
  }

  .hp-ov__eyebrow::before {
    content: "";
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--hp-ov-accent);
    flex: none;
  }

  .hp-ov__heading {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--hp-ov-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 40px;
    line-height: 48px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    color: var(--hp-ov-ink);
  }

  /* --- Row ----------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .hp-ov__row {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 300px);
    gap: 24px;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1272px;
  }

  /* --- Card ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .hp-ov__card {
    position: relative;
    width: 300px;
    height: 320px;
    /* Layout, not transform: the hover owns the transform, and an offset
       folded into it would have to be restated there or lost. */
    margin-block-start: calc(var(--hp-ov-offset, 0px) * var(--hp-ov-offset-scale, 1));
    transform: rotate(calc(var(--hp-ov-rot, 0deg) * var(--hp-ov-rot-scale, 1)));
    transition: transform 300ms ease;
  }

  /* The pebble is wider than its 300px column by 5px, so it is pulled back by
     half that rather than left to sit off-centre. */
  .hp-ov__shadow,
  .hp-ov__pebble {
    position: absolute;
    left: -2.5px;
    top: 50px;
    width: 305px;
    height: 270px;
  }

  .hp-ov__shadow {
    z-index: 1;
    transform: translate(8px, 8px);
  }

  .hp-ov__pebble { z-index: 2; }

  .hp-ov__shadow svg,
  .hp-ov__pebble svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .hp-ov__badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 108px;
    z-index: 4;
    width: 84px;
    height: 84px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border: var(--hp-ov-badge-line-w) solid var(--hp-ov-badge-line);
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--hp-ov-badge-bg, #C2D6A8);
    transform: rotate(var(--hp-ov-badge-rot, -8deg));
  }

  /* Cards 2 and 4 in the reference carry the badge off to one side. */
  .hp-ov__card--badge-right .hp-ov__badge { left: 126px; }

  .hp-ov__badge svg {
    display: block;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
  }

  .hp-ov__copy {
    position: absolute;
    left: 45px;
    top: 50px;
    bottom: 0;
    z-index: 3;
    width: 210px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hp-ov__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--hp-ov-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 22px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--hp-ov-ink);
  }

  .hp-ov__body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--hp-ov-body);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 22px;
    color: var(--hp-ov-muted);
  }

  /* --- Sprinkles ----------------------------------------------------------
     Placed as a share of the row so they hold their arrangement as it
     narrows, rather than px that would bunch at one end. */
  .hp-ov__sprinkle {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }

  /* --- Hover (pointers only) ----------------------------------------------- */
  @media (hover: hover) {
    .hp-ov__card:hover {
      transform: rotate(0deg) translateY(-4px);
    }
  }

  /* --- Tablet: two by two -------------------------------------------------- */
  @media screen and (max-width: 1319px) {
    .hp-ov__row {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 300px);
      row-gap: 48px;
      max-width: 624px;
    }

    /* The full offsets were measured against one long row. Kept at strength
       in a 2x2 they would leave a 140px hole in the middle of the block. */
    .hp-ov__card { --hp-ov-offset-scale: 0.35; }

    /* The dots are placed as shares of the 1272x470 row they were arranged
       in. A 2x2 row is roughly 624x1000, so the same shares put them on top
       of the pebbles rather than in the gaps around them. They belong to the
       wide arrangement and go with it. */
    .hp-ov__sprinkle { display: none; }
  }

  /* --- Phone: one column --------------------------------------------------- */
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .hp-ov {
      gap: 48px;
      padding-block: var(--hp-ov-pt-mobile) var(--hp-ov-pb-mobile);
    }

    .hp-ov__heading { font-size: 28px; line-height: 34px; }

    .hp-ov__row {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 300px);
      row-gap: 32px;
      max-width: 300px;
    }

    .hp-ov__card {
      --hp-ov-offset-scale: 0;
      /* A tilt that reads as scatter across a row reads as a mistake in a
         single column, where every card is measured against the one above. */
      --hp-ov-rot-scale: 0.3;
    }

  }

  /* --- Reduced motion ------------------------------------------------------ */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hp-ov__card { transition: none; }
    .hp-ov__card:hover { transform: rotate(calc(var(--hp-ov-rot, 0deg) * var(--hp-ov-rot-scale, 1))); }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div
  class="hp-ov"
  style="
    --hp-ov-bg: {{ s.background | default: '#F0C4A8' }};
    --hp-ov-ink: {{ s.ink_color | default: '#2F3427' }};
    --hp-ov-pebble-line: {{ s.pebble_outline | default: '#2F3427' }};
    --hp-ov-badge-line: {{ s.badge_outline | default: '#2F3427' }};
    --hp-ov-badge-line-w: {{ badge_line_w }}px;
    --hp-ov-muted: {{ s.body_color | default: '#5E6152' }};
    --hp-ov-accent: {{ s.accent_color | default: '#E06E4C' }};
    --hp-ov-shadow: {{ s.shadow_color | default: '#ECA47C' }};
    --hp-ov-eyebrow-bg: {{ s.eyebrow_background | default: '#FFFFFF' }};
    --hp-ov-pt: {{ s.padding_top | default: 130 }}px;
    --hp-ov-pb: {{ s.padding_bottom | default: 160 }}px;
    --hp-ov-pt-mobile: {{ s.padding_top_mobile | default: 72 }}px;
    --hp-ov-pb-mobile: {{ s.padding_bottom_mobile | default: 88 }}px;
  "
  {{ section.shopify_attributes }}
>
  {%- if s.eyebrow != blank or s.heading != blank -%}
    <div class="hp-ov__head">
      {%- if s.eyebrow != blank -%}
        <p class="hp-ov__eyebrow">{{ s.eyebrow }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if s.heading != blank -%}
        <h2 class="hp-ov__heading">{{ s.heading }}</h2>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="hp-ov__row">
    {%- if s.show_sprinkles != false -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        Five fixed dots. Positions are the brief's, turned into shares of the
        1272 x 470 row they were measured in.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign sprinkles = '0,85.1,14,accent|23.6,8.5,20,cream|50.3,70.2,16,accent|75.5,12.8,24,sage|99.4,89.4,18,cream' | split: '|' -%}
      {%- for sp in sprinkles -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign parts = sp | split: ','
          assign sx = parts[0]
          assign sy = parts[1]
          assign ss = parts[2]
          assign skind = parts[3]
          case skind
            when 'accent'
              assign scolor = s.accent_color | default: '#E06E4C'
            when 'sage'
              assign scolor = s.sprinkle_sage | default: '#C2D6A8'
            else
              assign scolor = s.sprinkle_cream | default: '#FCF9F4'
          endcase
        -%}
        <span
          class="hp-ov__sprinkle"
          aria-hidden="true"
          style="left: {{ sx }}%; top: {{ sy }}%; width: {{ ss }}px; height: {{ ss }}px; background: {{ scolor }};"
        ></span>
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign b = block.settings
        assign badge_pos = b.badge_position | default: 'centre'
        assign badge_rot = b.badge_rotation | default: -8
      -%}
      <div
        class="hp-ov__card{% if badge_pos == 'right' %} hp-ov__card--badge-right{% endif %}"
        style="
          --hp-ov-rot: {{ b.rotation | default: 0 }}deg;
          --hp-ov-offset: {{ b.offset_y | default: 0 }}px;
          --hp-ov-badge-bg: {{ b.badge_background | default: '#C2D6A8' }};
          --hp-ov-badge-rot: {{ badge_rot }}deg;
        "
        {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
      >
        <div class="hp-ov__shadow" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" focusable="false">
            <path d="{{ shadow_d }}" fill="var(--hp-ov-shadow)"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="hp-ov__pebble" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" focusable="false">
            <path
              d="{{ pebble_d }}"
              fill="{{ b.pebble_fill | default: '#FCF9F4' }}"
              stroke="var(--hp-ov-pebble-line)"
              stroke-width="{{ pebble_line_w }}"
              vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="hp-ov__badge">
          {%- liquid
            assign icon = b.icon | default: 'heart'
            assign icon_color = b.icon_color | default: '#E06E4C'
          -%}
          <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            {%- case icon -%}
              {%- when 'heart' -%}
                <path
                  d="M20 35 C 6 25, 2 16, 7 10 C 11 5, 18 6, 20 11 C 22 6, 29 5, 33 10 C 38 16, 34 25, 20 35 Z"
                  fill="{{ icon_color }}"
                ></path>
              {%- when 'loop' -%}
                <g fill="none" stroke="{{ icon_color }}" stroke-width="4"
                   stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M7 22 A 13 13 0 0 1 27 10"></path>
                  <path d="M21 7 L28 10 L26 17"></path>
                  <path d="M33 18 A 13 13 0 0 1 13 30"></path>
                  <path d="M19 33 L12 30 L14 23"></path>
                </g>
              {%- when 'clip' -%}
                <path
                  d="M26 13 L13.5 25.5 a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 7.8 7.8 L33 21.5 a9 9 0 0 0-12.7-12.7 L8.5 20.5 a12.5 12.5 0 0 0 17.7 17.7"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="{{ icon_color }}"
                  stroke-width="4"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                ></path>
              {%- when 'bunny' -%}
                <g fill="{{ icon_color }}">
                  <ellipse cx="15" cy="11" rx="3.6" ry="8" transform="rotate(-12 15 11)"></ellipse>
                  <ellipse cx="25" cy="11" rx="3.6" ry="8" transform="rotate(12 25 11)"></ellipse>
                  <ellipse cx="20" cy="27" rx="11" ry="9"></ellipse>
                </g>
                <circle cx="16.2" cy="25.5" r="1.9" fill="#FFFFFF"></circle>
                <circle cx="23.8" cy="25.5" r="1.9" fill="#FFFFFF"></circle>
              {%- when 'star' -%}
                <path
                  d="M20 4 L24.6 15.4 L36.8 16.3 L27.4 24.2 L30.4 36 L20 29.5 L9.6 36 L12.6 24.2 L3.2 16.3 L15.4 15.4 Z"
                  fill="{{ icon_color }}"
                ></path>
            {%- endcase -%}
          </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="hp-ov__copy">
          {%- if b.title != blank -%}
            <h3 class="hp-ov__title">{{ b.title }}</h3>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if b.body != blank -%}
            <p class="hp-ov__body">{{ b.body }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Our values",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "hp-our-values-section",
  "max_blocks": 6,
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Header" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Our values" },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Little things, made with a lot of care."
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Colours" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "background", "label": "Section background", "default": "#F0C4A8" },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "shadow_color",
      "label": "Behind each pebble",
      "default": "#ECA47C",
      "info": "The hard offset shape behind each card. A shade or two darker than the background."
    },
    { "type": "color", "id": "ink_color", "label": "Ink", "default": "#2F3427", "info": "The heading, the eyebrow and the card titles. The outlines have their own colours below." },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "pebble_outline",
      "label": "Pebble outline",
      "default": "#2F3427",
      "info": "The line drawn around each pebble."
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "pebble_outline_width",
      "label": "Pebble outline width",
      "unit": "px",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 6,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 2,
      "info": "Set to 0 for no outline at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "badge_outline",
      "label": "Badge outline",
      "default": "#2F3427",
      "info": "The ring around each icon circle. Set it to match the pebble outline unless you want the badges to read as separate stickers."
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "badge_outline_width",
      "label": "Badge outline width",
      "unit": "px",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 6,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 2,
      "info": "Set to 0 for no ring. The circle keeps its 84px either way, so nothing shifts."
    },
    { "type": "color", "id": "body_color", "label": "Body text", "default": "#5E6152" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "accent_color", "label": "Accent", "default": "#E06E4C", "info": "The eyebrow dot and two of the sprinkles." },
    { "type": "color", "id": "eyebrow_background", "label": "Eyebrow pill", "default": "#FFFFFF" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Sprinkles" },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_sprinkles",
      "label": "Show the scattered dots",
      "default": true,
      "info": "Five dots placed around the row. Hidden on a phone either way, where there is no room beside the cards."
    },
    { "type": "color", "id": "sprinkle_sage", "label": "Sprinkle — green", "default": "#C2D6A8" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "sprinkle_cream", "label": "Sprinkle — cream", "default": "#FCF9F4" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Spacing" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding_top", "label": "Top padding (desktop)", "unit": "px", "min": 0, "max": 240, "step": 5, "default": 130 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding_bottom", "label": "Bottom padding (desktop)", "unit": "px", "min": 0, "max": 240, "step": 5, "default": 160 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding_top_mobile", "label": "Top padding (mobile)", "unit": "px", "min": 0, "max": 160, "step": 4, "default": 72 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding_bottom_mobile", "label": "Bottom padding (mobile)", "unit": "px", "min": 0, "max": 160, "step": 4, "default": 88 }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "value",
      "name": "Value",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Title", "default": "Made by hand" },
        {
          "type": "textarea",
          "id": "body",
          "label": "Body",
          "default": "Cut and sewn in small batches, so every one gets looked at properly."
        },
        { "type": "header", "content": "Icon" },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "icon",
          "label": "Icon",
          "options": [
            { "value": "heart", "label": "Heart" },
            { "value": "loop", "label": "Loop — washable, reusable" },
            { "value": "clip", "label": "Clip" },
            { "value": "bunny", "label": "Bunny face" },
            { "value": "star", "label": "Star" }
          ],
          "default": "heart"
        },
        { "type": "color", "id": "icon_color", "label": "Icon colour", "default": "#E06E4C" },
        { "type": "color", "id": "badge_background", "label": "Badge circle", "default": "#C2D6A8" },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "badge_position",
          "label": "Badge position",
          "options": [
            { "value": "centre", "label": "Centred" },
            { "value": "right", "label": "Off to the right" }
          ],
          "default": "centre"
        },
        {
          "type": "range",
          "id": "badge_rotation",
          "label": "Badge tilt",
          "unit": "deg",
          "min": -15,
          "max": 15,
          "step": 1,
          "default": -8
        },
        { "type": "header", "content": "Shape" },
        { "type": "color", "id": "pebble_fill", "label": "Pebble fill", "default": "#FCF9F4" },
        {
          "type": "range",
          "id": "rotation",
          "label": "Tilt",
          "unit": "deg",
          "min": -15,
          "max": 15,
          "step": 1,
          "default": -3
        },
        {
          "type": "range",
          "id": "offset_y",
          "label": "Drop",
          "unit": "px",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 200,
          "step": 10,
          "default": 60,
          "info": "How far down the row this pebble sits. Eased off in a two-up layout and ignored in a single column."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Our values",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "value",
